OL,3,AGermany's Merz attacks AfD in stormy
OL,4,Adebate after far-right election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz has
OL,7,Fclashed with AfD leader Alice Weidel in
OL,8,Fparliament, calling her party a
OL,9,F"destructive force" with a migration
OL,10,Fpolicy that amounts to "ethnic
OL,11,Fcleansing" for skilled workers.
OL,13,FMerz was addressing the Bundestag in
OL,14,Fthe aftermath of the anti-immigration
OL,15,Fparty's sweeping victory in the eastern
OL,16,Fstate of Saxony-Anhalt where it won
OL,17,Falmost 44% of the vote, while the
OL,18,Fchancellor's conservatives saw their
OL,19,Fvote halved.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
