OL,3,AGermany's Merz attacks AfD in stormy
OL,4,Adebate after far-right election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FWeidel told MPs that voters had shown
OL,7,Fthat Merz's coalition with the centre
OL,8,Fleft was a total failure and his time
OL,9,Fwas up.
OL,11,FMerz hit back saying the AfD had harmed
OL,12,FGerman interests by backing Russia, and
OL,13,Fits "remigration" policy would affect
OL,14,Fmillions.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
